      "content": "i know you say that but it doesn't feel like it. it feels more like a math equation. i'm just taking more than i'm giving. if i just wasn't part of the equation anymore, her life would actually get better. it's almost like the most loving thing i could do is just... stop being a problem for her. to just give her that freedom back.",
